# MUZZLE FLASH: a cannon's shot (cannonShell.pre MuzzleFlash; GameProjectileComponent::spawn emits a few puffs where
# the shell starts, just ahead of the barrel's mouth, on every role, with shell_flash.pfx, muzzle_smoke.pfx and a short
# point light). As big as the impact's burst (shell_blast.pfx): a shower of pale-cyan light shards thrown out. A puff
# plays the FIRST emitter only. `Rate` 0 and `Burst` = the puff's particle count. Colors are linear HDR (rgb *
# intensity); the scene tonemaps, so bright additive values glow.
ParticleEffect MuzzleFlash
	Emitter Burst
		Texture Textures/Particles/spark.dds
		Rate 0
		Burst 40
		SpawnRadius 0.4
		Offset 0, 0, 0
		ConeAngle 170
		Speed 5.0 12.0
		Life 0.3 0.8
		Gravity 6.0
		Drag 2.0
		Turbulence 1.5 1.0 0.5
		Size 0.45 0.08
		SizeVariance 0.5
		VelocityStretch 0.05
		ColorStart 12.0, 28.0, 38.0, 1
		ColorEnd 1.5, 5.0, 8.0, 0
		Additivity 1
		FadeIn 0.01
		FadeOutStart 0.35
		SoftFade 0.1
